<title>USA: Wabash National in marketing agreement.</title>
<headline>Wabash National in marketing agreement.</headline>
<dateline>LAFAYETTE, Ind. 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wabash National Corp said Wednesday it entered into a marketing agreement with Bernard Krone Fahrzeugwerke GmbH of Wertle, Germany.</p>
<p>Under the agreement, Krone will market Wabash National's over-the-road refrigerated trailers and dry freight vans throughout Europe.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
